{"about_the_game":"&quot;Buy fish. Feed fish. Watch fish grow.<br>\u00a0Sell fish - if you want more.<br>\u00a0Relax. Repeat. And feel relief.<br>\u00a0While you leave, they live.&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946700/extras/70c025d256640300db0a237cf594e03c.poster.avif?t=1766787001\" width=780 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946700/extras/70c025d256640300db0a237cf594e03c.webm?t=1766787001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946700/extras/70c025d256640300db0a237cf594e03c.mp4?t=1766787001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\u201cJust Fish\u201d is a relaxing idle aquarium for quiet moments.\u00a0<br>Get fish from themed collection packs and watch them grow in real time.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946700/extras/fbc5d8bed7b792475257c28b20eb0739.poster.avif?t=1766787001\" width=780 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946700/extras/fbc5d8bed7b792475257c28b20eb0739.webm?t=1766787001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946700/extras/fbc5d8bed7b792475257c28b20eb0739.mp4?t=1766787001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Feed to help them grow faster.\u00a0<br>Sell adult fish to buy more fry and discover rarer species - or keep them for steady income.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946700/extras/a017aa1158d18b0ccb691495f809531b.poster.avif?t=1766787001\" width=780 height=3